    "detailed_description": "Mango Goes to Mewsic School is a cute rhythm game where you play as a cat, Mango, trying to get into music school.<br><br>Traverse a trap-laden environment to learn from the masters, who will teach you the basics of four different music genres: afrobeats, jazz, classical, and K-pop. Become the best possible applicant by training your ears and mastering your craft!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/1d3b2e7a7e4a87bdf90e1331cb38816c.avif?t=1710019437\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br><strong>EXPLORE FOUR MEWSICAL LANDS</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/aebc66b0bd4db26ed00c10da13bf3ca4.poster.avif?t=1710019437\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/aebc66b0bd4db26ed00c10da13bf3ca4.webm?t=1710019437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/aebc66b0bd4db26ed00c10da13bf3ca4.mp4?t=1710019437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Discover four different mewsical lands, each with its own genre of mewsic. Dodge deadly traps and choose your own path to each mewsical battle!<br><br><strong>TOUR A CUTE AND COZY WORLD</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/19a065fe0b314073c2c6635d4c445f39.poster.avif?t=1710019437\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/19a065fe0b314073c2c6635d4c445f39.webm?t=1710019437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/19a065fe0b314073c2c6635d4c445f39.mp4?t=1710019437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Immerse yourself in Mango\u2019s world as you talk to cute and supporting characters.  Relax to the soothing music and dialogue that match the cozy atmosphere!<br><br><strong>MASTER FOUR DIFFERENT MEWSICAL GENRES</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/3cfbbd65d5e0da3a213336d18540273a.poster.avif?t=1710019437\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/3cfbbd65d5e0da3a213336d18540273a.webm?t=1710019437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/3cfbbd65d5e0da3a213336d18540273a.mp4?t=1710019437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Roll the dice and complete timed rhythm challenges to master each mewsical genre.  Adapt to increasing challenges with new curveballs thrown your way!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/4b6704af0b6b504db4034cb2d035a07d.avif?t=1710019437\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br>This game was made by students in the University of Southern California\u2019s Interactive Media and Games program in collaboration with students from the Berklee College of Music. The game was developed by Cecil Kong, Kaya Cook, Alyssa Harrison, Christopher Ken San Tan, Andy Lin, Jack Schooley, and Karina Wang. For more information, check out our publisher page. To learn more about the USC Games program, please visit the USC Games website.",
    "about_the_game": "Mango Goes to Mewsic School is a cute rhythm game where you play as a cat, Mango, trying to get into music school.<br><br>Traverse a trap-laden environment to learn from the masters, who will teach you the basics of four different music genres: afrobeats, jazz, classical, and K-pop. Become the best possible applicant by training your ears and mastering your craft!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/1d3b2e7a7e4a87bdf90e1331cb38816c.avif?t=1710019437\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br><strong>EXPLORE FOUR MEWSICAL LANDS</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/aebc66b0bd4db26ed00c10da13bf3ca4.poster.avif?t=1710019437\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/aebc66b0bd4db26ed00c10da13bf3ca4.webm?t=1710019437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/aebc66b0bd4db26ed00c10da13bf3ca4.mp4?t=1710019437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Discover four different mewsical lands, each with its own genre of mewsic. Dodge deadly traps and choose your own path to each mewsical battle!<br><br><strong>TOUR A CUTE AND COZY WORLD</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/19a065fe0b314073c2c6635d4c445f39.poster.avif?t=1710019437\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/19a065fe0b314073c2c6635d4c445f39.webm?t=1710019437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/19a065fe0b314073c2c6635d4c445f39.mp4?t=1710019437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Immerse yourself in Mango\u2019s world as you talk to cute and supporting characters.  Relax to the soothing music and dialogue that match the cozy atmosphere!<br><br><strong>MASTER FOUR DIFFERENT MEWSICAL GENRES</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/3cfbbd65d5e0da3a213336d18540273a.poster.avif?t=1710019437\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/3cfbbd65d5e0da3a213336d18540273a.webm?t=1710019437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/3cfbbd65d5e0da3a213336d18540273a.mp4?t=1710019437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Roll the dice and complete timed rhythm challenges to master each mewsical genre.  Adapt to increasing challenges with new curveballs thrown your way!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611620/extras/4b6704af0b6b504db4034cb2d035a07d.avif?t=1710019437\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br>This game was made by students in the University of Southern California\u2019s Interactive Media and Games program in collaboration with students from the Berklee College of Music. The game was developed by Cecil Kong, Kaya Cook, Alyssa Harrison, Christopher Ken San Tan, Andy Lin, Jack Schooley, and Karina Wang. For more information, check out our publisher page. To learn more about the USC Games program, please visit the USC Games website.",
